    i "A bit more than a year prior, they accepted a job offer overseas. Despite their insistent attempts at making us accompany them, we were strongly against it, as we'd lived in Yushibana our whole lives. The idea of traveling to another continent wasn't a pleasant one. Unlike them, we didn't even know the language there."
    i "They eventually had to give up and accepted paying for our necessary expenses like food and rent. We'd lived by ourselves since then."
