    i "Shiroya and I disliked Ashiya to an extent, but Miiya, having moved to Yushibana as a kid, didn't share the same feeling that had been prominently pushed onto us by the older residents. She had only been vaguely told about the main outline of it all, so when she proposed that we attend the event, we didn't refuse."
    i "It honestly sounded like a fine idea to us. Anything the three of us could go to was good.{w} According to the announcement, an event was held in Ashiya Tower every Thursday, each one requiring special entrance tickets."
