    n "This means that if I had traveled holding the bedroom key, chances are I wouldn't have appeared with it in the past. Akaro and Sai wouldn't have encountered that problem since, for them, the key would've always been under the bathroom's carpet.{w} But... no, that shouldn't have been a problem. I could've used one of the handles we left under the beds. There might've been another screwdriver in the opposite bedroom, and even if there wasn't, putting in screws without a screwdriver isn't too hard. Could it be that wasn't possible because it wasn't part of the loop I'd thought of...? Or maybe I just wouldn't have been able to do it without alerting Akaro."
