            c "But he knew what had been happening around them. He knew that, for some reason, Sai wanted them dead. He'd somehow acquired a knife and abused the Sekimeiya's powers. It was very unlikely he could reach their position, but depending on his true motives, the chase might've continued even after exiting the tower."
