    c "Amidst the vast internet was a specific forum thread."
    c "The date showed it had been written in the afternoon of November 24th, 2011. It contained two paragraphs."
    c4 "I swear this is all the truth, I'm not messing around. I'm a bit scared, though, and I'm not sure what to do."
    c4 "I think I just woke up from a really strange dream. It felt hyperrealistic, and I'm still shaking..."
    c4 "I don't know if it means anything. Maybe it was a premonition, I'm not sure. However, I'd be careful on the 15th of next month."
    c4 "If I don't say this anonymously, I'll be laughed at, or even fired... On the 15th, Ashiya will hold a big event in the tower, and there'll be a terrorist attack."
    c4 "It will be called... the Sekimeiya."
    c4 "Soon, maybe they will announce it. I don't think I'm a prophet or anything, but I'm still trying to calm down. This time, it felt too real to let it pass."
    nvl clear
    with dissolve
    c4 "That's what I dreamed. It's so bizarre I still think it might've really happened. That's why I feel the need to post it, in case it actually means something."
    c4 "Do not go to that event if it happens. Some people even got trapped inside, but I don't know what happened to them."
    c4 "I think something might be wrong with me... I don't know why, but I'm not home. I can hardly believe it's still the 24th, and I don't know what I'm doing at my parents' house."
    c4 "Sorry to rant about this, but I need to let it out somewhere. I've been suffering from a few mental issues, but nothing has been as bad as this. I've been living alone for two years while my condition has gotten worse and worse. I feel I can't continue on my own, and letting people around me know it might be a horrible idea."
    c4 "Anyway, maybe some of you will have some advice. I know posting here isn't the most effective thing, but it's very hard for me to talk about this out loud. Thank you for reading."
