    i "The truth. We knew nothing about what had happened."
    #play music "<loop 10.402>music/unintentional.ogg" fadein 8
    i "Even though many of the strange things that had occurred felt at least theoretically possible to understand, when I tried to think about them, I couldn't."
    i "Maybe the problem was that I couldn't be sure if I was right about anything, but technically, there was proof that untangling the day's events was possible."
    i "The existence of the Atsuki we'd talked to was inexplicable, but the fact that he'd known what would happen and told us of a certain outcome proved that the truth was attainable."
    i "Despite that, as the seconds ticked along, the answers I tried to reach changed more and more."
