    c "The police concluded that Isla Majutsu, the second victim, had died many hours after {time=9.}{w} Yet, they had very few clues as to what had occurred. Almost all the recorded footage had been erased, and what remained was useless. The belongings of the two victims contained nothing of importance, and neither did any place in the building.{w} That only made things more confusing, because despite the belief of many citizens, nothing else had been stolen beyond the gemstones that had been found in the morning."
