    c "Soon, Ashiya went quiet. After days spent repeating themselves, it seemed they'd chosen to drop the subject entirely."
    c "The news had been covered all over the nation and had even reached overseas. When it was noticed that Ashiya had stopped defending themselves from harsh criticism, it was assumed they'd concluded they were done for."
    c "And that was correct. The next time an executive of Ashiya was seen, they were recorded exiting the tower, loading covered boxes onto a truck."
    c "Later that day, from her apartment, Shiroya saw that scene being broadcast."
    nvl clear
    show bg tv
    with dissolve
    c5 "So, is it true that you're abandoning the tower? It's been speculated you're selling it. Is that correct? What do you have to say about all the employees you left without a job?" #maybe they should reply that they were probably with xythn anyway
    c "There was no reply from the Ashiya member."
