    #bg: living room (i don't have one with the tv on)
    c "Shiroya reached out to pet Maxi. In the corner, Umi's eyes seemed to be fixed on the screen, her dark fur camouflaged in the dim room."
    nvl clear
    with dissolve
    $ Pause(0.5)
    c "The screen morphed into static, the audio going with it. As the signal was very poor, it was frequently interrupted."
    c "Staring at the television, Shiroya felt traces of motion sickness. Was it due to the rapidly flashing screen? It almost didn't seem that way."
    c "Long ago, evolution had developed motion sickness. When one's sight blurred, as they could've been poisoned, they would react by vomiting to expel the poison. Shiroya was unsure if the static just made her feel that way or if her entire life had been poisoned."
    c "Alone in her apartment, she didn't look away until the signal resolved.{w} When it did, someone else was speaking about the same topic, but very far from the tower."
