    c "Why? He couldn't comprehend what he was seeing.{w} Had there been two Sekimeiya?"
    c "Atase had to rush, but he didn't know what to do. If he took both gemstones, Xyn's plan would never work.{w} Dumbfounded, he reached for one of the two; he could only replace a single one."
    c "He felt a screen of glass that he was able to slide open. Then, without placing his fingers on it, he took a gemstone out, swapping it with his.{w} Still in awe, he closed the glass and dropped the curtain down."
    #i was gonna make it so that he'd take out a real sekimeiya with his bare hands. outside the cabinet, as soon as it powered on, he'd activate it, so he'd travel 0.00001 seconds to the future, meaning the sekimeiya would simply lose its glow and he'd have no idea he'd just traveled (which i think is kinda cool and should maybe be done somewhere else? i guess i can have katei do that)
