    show bg sekimeiyaroom20
    with dissolve
    c "That was one of his initial questions, but they didn't stop piling up. Atase would have to spend twelve hours in that building until he could leave."
    c "He didn't know how worried he had to be or what had triggered the alarm. Even though the building was full of cameras, he knew not to be afraid of them.{w} He was told the internet connection had been cut by the alarm. In the meantime, Xyn couldn't remotely access the computer. However, he knew his group well. According to Katei, at {time=21}, the connection would come back, and Xyn would immediately erase all the recorded footage."
